    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Homo sapiens giganticus</strong> - the corp-engineered <strong>heavy caste</strong>: towering slabs of muscle bred for hazardous industry, demolition, load-bearing, and security/enforcement. The brute counterpart to the Corran's skilled labor. \"Ogre\" is the slur; <strong>Goliar</strong> is the name.</p><p><strong>Attributes:</strong> +2 Physique, -1 Reflex, -1 Presence (the only +2 chassis in the game - the most physically front-loaded species). Obeys normal tier attribute caps.</p><p><strong>Free at creation (Tier 5):</strong> the signature <strong>Towering Menace</strong> (Large size + Crushing Might + Intimidating Bulk), plus <strong>Powerful Build</strong>, <strong>Thick Hide</strong>, <strong>Iron Stomach</strong>, and <strong>Hard to Move</strong>. Unified species, no subtypes. Fully mundane; breeds true and cannot interbreed.</p><p>Nine BP-purchased, tier-gated options span offense, control, movement, defense, and utility - capped by <em>Colossus</em> at Tier 1.</p>",
      "director": ""
    },
